{"id":"n58040-3-7","stage":5,"title":"뒤엎다 · 变更","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58040-3-7-1","ko":"그 책이 그렇게 재미있어?","zh":"那本书有那么有趣吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"책이","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책이","audio":"/audio/3898f40e123c46cffc91.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있어?","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있어","audio":"/audio/4b3c167acd6f1da7e9ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/54474f9816701d56343d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58040-3-7-2","ko":"응. 우리의 상상을 뒤엎는 기묘한 얘기들이 많아.","zh":"嗯。里面有很多颠覆我们想象、十分奇特的故事。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"우리의","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리의","audio":"/audio/ef1227a2f8b0064b0e62.mp3"}},{"text":"상상을","meaning":"想象","explanation":"상상：想象；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상상","audio":"/audio/ed40e7f079b60105803a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61734","senseId":"1","lemma":"상상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상상을","audio":"/audio/467882e6e498bff0f5bb.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤엎는","meaning":"变更，取消","explanation":"뒤엎다：变更，取消；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"뒤엎다","audio":"/audio/a5ced9a8ed2c0ae087cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58040","senseId":"3","lemma":"뒤엎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤엎는","audio":"/audio/c89708bdf8006bdee9cb.mp3"}},{"text":"기묘한","meaning":"奇特，奇妙，神奇","explanation":"기묘하다：奇特，奇妙，神奇；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"기묘하다","audio":"/audio/3276b96aac18dbf31a1b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40058","senseId":"1","lemma":"기묘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기묘한","audio":"/audio/b403a3f2b05a74465a82.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기들이","meaning":"故事","explanation":"얘기：故事；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"3","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기들이","audio":"/audio/4b50b6fd3985edb9ad83.mp3"}},{"text":"많아.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아","audio":"/audio/cddc8e9fac3b225d8a31.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"ed40e7f079b60105","term":"상상","zh":"想象","audio":"/audio/ed40e7f079b60105803a.mp3","entryId":"61734","definition":"在脑海中刻画实际不存在或没有经历过的东西。","pronunciation":["상ː상"]},{"id":"a5ced9a8ed2c0ae0","term":"뒤엎다","zh":"变更，取消","audio":"/audio/a5ced9a8ed2c0ae087cf.mp3","entryId":"58040","definition":"使事情的方向或状态完全改变。","pronunciation":["뒤업따"]},{"id":"3276b96aac18dbf3","term":"기묘하다","zh":"奇特，奇妙，神奇","audio":"/audio/3276b96aac18dbf31a1b.mp3","entryId":"40058","definition":"稀奇不寻常。","pronunciation":["기묘하다"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"故事","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"把某事实或不存在的事经过修饰后，像真实事件一般有趣地讲述出来。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d8dc4a4a8700267b0c43.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58040","label":"国立